-<section id="opintel-app" aria-labelledby="form-controls-title">
-<h2 id="form-controls-title">Form controls</h2>
-<p>Use <code>.inp</code> for typed values and <code>.sel</code> for a choice from a fixed list. Both use the same base, focus, disabled and invalid states. The native select adds only its chevron and clearance; keyboard and screen-reader behaviour remain native. Labels are visible. Yellow is not an error colour: invalid uses the existing held/error token.</p>
-<p>The examples load the master stylesheet. Focus examples illustrate its focus ring. The master has no dark palette; no dark-mode tokens or examples are invented here. The chevron fill must equal <code>--ink</code>, checked by conformance.</p>
-<style>#opintel-app [data-example-state="focus"] :is(.inp,.sel){outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:-1px}</style>
-<table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Text input</th><th>Native select</th></tr></thead><tbody>
